  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/P1180281.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(70 fotos) La tarde de este viernes se ha inaugurado en el Casal Jove de Onda la III Feria de Asociaciones, que <a href=\"http://onda.es/la-ciudad/eventos/iii-fira-d-associacions\" target=\"_blank\">se desarrollar&aacute; tambi&eacute;n durante toda la jornada del s&aacute;bado con un completo programa</a> y que culminar&aacute; con un concierto de Dustin Rock&#39;n&#39;Roll.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugiiifiraassociacions15/p1180261.jpg\" alt=\"p1180261\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugiiifiraassociacions15/p1180262.jpg\" alt=\"p1180262\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugiiifiraassociacions15/p1180263.jpg\" alt=\"p1180263\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugiiifiraassociacions15/p1180264.jpg\" alt=\"p1180264\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugiiifiraassociacions15/p1180265.jpg\" alt=\"p1180265\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugiiifiraassociacions15/p1180266.jpg\" alt=\"p1180266\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugiiifiraassociacions15/p1180267.jpg\" alt=\"p1180267\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugiiifiraassociacions15/p1180268.jpg\" alt=\"p1180268\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugii